νιφατίου\">ΒΟΝΙΦΑ</span></span>𐆠<span data-text=\"μνεμνῖον\">Μ<span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Ν͡Ε</span>ΜΝΙΟΝ</span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"ἡ\">Η</span><span data-text=\"τῶν\">ΤΩΝ</span><span data-text=\"πολῶνπολλῶν\">ΠΟΛΩΝ</span><span data-text=\"θλίψεων\">ΘΛΙΨΕΩΝ</span><span data-text=\"ὑπωμονὴ\">ΥΠΩΜΟ<span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Ν͡Η</span></span><span data-text=\"ἐλπίδα\">ΕΛΠΙΔΑ</span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"σωτηρίας\">ΣΩΤΗΡΙΑΣ</span><span data-text=\"κατεργάζετε\">ΚΑΤΕΡΓΑΖΕΤΕ</span><span data-text=\"πᾶσιν\">ΠΑΣΙΝ</span><span data-text=\"οὖν\">ΟΥ<span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Ν</span></span><span data-text=\"ἡμῖν\"><span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Η͡Μ</span>ΙΝ</span><span data-text=\"τοῖς\">ΤΟΙΣ</span><span data-text=\"πο\n                    θοῦσιν\">ΠΟ<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>ΘΟΥΣΙΝ</span><span data-text=\"ζωῆς\">ΖΩΗΣ</span><span data-text=\"αἰωνίου\">ΑΙΩΝΙΟΥ</span><span data-text=\"τυχῖν\">ΤΥΧΙΝ</span><span data-text=\"προσκίσθω\">ΠΡΟΣΚΙΣΘΩ</span><span data-text=\"καὶ\">ΚΑΙ</span><span data-text=\"ἡ\">Η</span><span data-text=\"τῆς\">ΤΗΣ</span><br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span><span data-text=\"ὑπομονῆς\">ΥΠΟΜΟ<span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Ν͡Η</span>Σ</span><span data-text=\"πρᾶξις\">ΠΡΑΞΙΣ</span><span data-text=\"δι’\">ΔΙ</span><span data-text=\"ἧς\">ΗΣ</span><span class=\"error\" title=\"hi tag with rend=tail is not supported!\">Κ</span>ΠΟΛΛΟΙΖΩΗΣΟΥΡΑΝΙΟΥΕΤΥΧΟΝ<br id=\"al6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span><span data-text=\"ὅθεν\">ΟΘΕΝ</span><span data-text=\"κἀγὼ\">ΚΑΓΩ</span><span data-text=\"ὁ\">Ο</span><span data-text=\"πάμπαν\">ΠΑΜΠΑΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἁμαρτωλὸς\">ΑΜΑΡΤΩΛΟΣ</span><span data-text=\"ηὐξάμνη\">ΗΥΞΑ<span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Μ͡Ν͡Η</span></span><span data-text=\"τοῦ\">ΤΟΥ</span><span data-text=\"Βίου\">ΒΙΟΥ</span><br id=\"al7-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span><span data-text=\"τούτου\">ΤΟΥΤΟΥ</span><span data-text=\"τὴν\">Τ<span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Η͡Ν</span></span><span data-text=\"παροικίαν\">ΠΑΡΟΙΚΙΑΝ</span><span data-text=\"τάχιον\">ΑΙΟΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἐκφυγῖν\">ΕΚΦΥΓΙΝ</span><span data-text=\"καί\">Κ</span><span data-text=\"γε\">ΓΕ</span><span data-text=\"εὐξά\n                    μενος\">ΕΥΞΑ<br id=\"al8-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8</span>ΜΕΝΟΣ</span><span data-text=\"τούτου\">ΤΟΥΤΟΥ</span><span data-text=\"ἔτυχον\">ΕΤΥΧΟΝ</span><span data-text=\"μετὰ\">ΜΑ</span><span data-text=\"τὴν\">Τ<span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Η͡Ν</span></span><span data-text=\"ἐκ\">ΕΚ</span><span data-text=\"τοῦ\">ΤΟΥ</span><span data-text=\"βίου\">ΒΙΟΥ</span><span data-text=\"ἐπὶ\">ΕΠΙ</span><span data-text=\"τὴν\">Τ<span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Η͡Ν</span></span><br id=\"al9-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">9</span><span data-text=\"δικαιωσύνην\">ΔΙΚΑΙΩΣΥ<span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Ν͡Η͡Ν</span></span><span data-text=\"μεταβολὴν\">ΜΕΤΑΒΟΛ<span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Η͡Ν</span></span><span data-text=\"ἀπὸ\">ΑΟ</span><span data-text=\"παντὸς\">ΠΑΝΤΟΣ</span><span data-text=\"τοὶνυν\">ΤΟΙΝΥΝ</span><span data-text=\"τοῦ\">ΤΟΥ</span><br id=\"al10-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">10</span><span data-text=\"ἀνεσθήτου\">ΑΝΕΣΘΗΤΟΥ</span><span data-text=\"βίου\">ΒΙΟΥ</span><span data-text=\"ἡ\">Η</span><span data-text=\"κοίμασις\">ΟΙΜΑΣ</span><span data-text=\"δοθήτω\">ΔΟΘΗΤΩ</span><span data-text=\"μετὰ\">ΜΕΤΑ</span><span data-text=\"τῆς\">ΤΗΣ</span><span data-text=\"ἐν\">ΕΝ</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"divine\" data-text=\"Χριστῷ\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Χριστῷ\">ΧΡΩ</span></span><br id=\"al11-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">11</span><span data-text=\"συνδούλης\">ΣΥΝΔΟΥΛΗΣ</span><span data-text=\"μου\">ΜΟΥ</span><span data-text=\"καὶ\"><span class=\"error\" title=\"hi tag with rend=tail is not supported!\">Κ</span></span><span data-text=\"γλυκυτάτης\">ΛΥ[..]ΤΑ<span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Τ͡Η</span>Σ</span><span data-text=\"μου\">ΜΟΥ</span><span data-text=\"μητρός\"><span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Μ͡Η</span>ΤΡΟΣ</span>𐆠</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\">l.2 reg., orig. ΠΟΛΩΝπολῶν</p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text after IG</span></span>; </li><li><span class=\"line 2\">line.2: <span>τῶν πολῶν pro τῶν πολλῶν</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 6\">line.6: <span>κἀγὼ ΙG XIV 531; κἀτὼ CIG IV 9497</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 7\">line.7: <span>Kaibel posits damage to the middle of the stone over lines 7-10, not reported by the antiquarian transcriber, but resulting in the various errors/oddities mid-line at that point onwards</span>  </span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 9\">line.9: <span>ἀὸ παντὸς ΙG XIV 531, Agnello; [δ]ι[ὰ] παντὸς</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 10\">line.10: <span>l. 10 ἡ οίμας IG XIV 531, Agnello; ἡ [κ]οίμ[ησις] CIG IV 9497</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo</a></p>  <p>Tomb of Boniface. The endurance of many afflictions brings the hope of salvation. May it be granted to all of us who desire eternal life to practice the patience through which many also attain heavenly life. Therefore I too, a sinner in all things, desired to flee soon from my stay in this life, and having asked for this, I obtained it after the passage of this life to righteousness. Therefore, may rest be granted to me from all this senseless life, together with my fellow servant in Christ and my most beloved mother.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The epitaph opens with the formula <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">μνημεῖον</span> followed by the genitive of the deceased's name (l. 1) and unfolds in a complex series of poetic images and gnomic sentences. In ll. 2-5 it is stated that endurance brings salvation, and that therefore those who aspire to eternal life must practice it. In ll. 6-9, the deceased defines himself, speaking in the first person (for which, see Agnello 1953, 79), as a sinner (l. 6 <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ὁ πάμπαν ἁμαρτωλός</span>): this rarely occurs in Christian epitaphs, but other examples can be found (ICUR IV 10535, VI 16073, cf. Dresken-Weiland 2006, 308). Boniface desired to flee from this life and obtained what he desired through the intervention of justice (ll. 8-9 <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἐπὶ τὴν δικαιωσύνην μεταβολήν</span>): the concept of <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"la\">iustitia</span> is rare in Christian epitaphs. In ll. 9-11 there is a final prayer for the granting of rest at the end of a senseless life (ll. 9-10 <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">τοῦ ἀνεσθήτου βίου</span>: the adjective <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἀναίσθητος</span> (sensless, which does not belong to the realm of the senses) is connected to death in epitaphs — cf. <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἀναισθήτῳ περὶ τύμβῳ</span> in IG VII 2543 l. 2 — whereas here it refers to earthly life, from which a respite is requested) for Boniface himself, for his wife (referred to in ll. 10-11 as \"fellow servant in Christ\", on the expression <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">δοῦλος ἐν Χριστῷ</span>, see IG XIV 442, 629), and for his mother.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Kirchhoff 1877 9474 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249</a>  </li><li> Kaibel 1890 <a href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">531</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072</a>  </li><li> Agnello 1953 no.47 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002211\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002211</a>  </li><li> 2006 56.1129 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796</a>  </li><li> 2006 56.1091 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li> Dresken-Weiland 2006 308 </li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
