      "html": "<div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Βονιφατίου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Βονιφατίου\">Βονιφα(τίου)</span></span> 𐆠 <span data-text=\"μνεμνῖον\">μ<span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">ν͡ε</span>μνῖον</span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"ἡ\">ἡ</span>  <span data-text=\"τῶν\">τῶν</span>  <span data-text=\"πολῶνπολλῶν\">πολῶν</span>  <span data-text=\"θλίψεων\">θλίψεων</span>  <span data-text=\"ὑπωμονὴ\">ὑπωμο<span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">ν͡ὴ</span></span>  <span data-text=\"ἐλπίδα\">ἐλπίδα</span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"σωτηρίας\">σωτηρίας</span>  <span data-text=\"κατεργάζετε\">κατεργάζετε</span>  <span data-text=\"πᾶσιν\">πᾶσιν</span>  <span data-text=\"οὖν\">οὖ<span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">ν</span></span>  <span data-text=\"ἡμῖν\"><span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">ἡ͡μ</span>ῖν</span>  <span data-text=\"τοῖς\">τοῖς</span>  <span data-text=\"πο\n                    θοῦσιν\">πο-<br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>θοῦσιν</span>  <span data-text=\"ζωῆς\">ζωῆς</span>  <span data-text=\"αἰωνίου\">αἰωνίου</span>  <span data-text=\"τυχῖν\">τυχῖν</span>  <span data-text=\"προσκίσθω\">προσκίσθω</span>  <span data-text=\"καὶ\">καὶ</span>  <span data-text=\"ἡ\">ἡ</span>  <span data-text=\"τῆς\">τῆς</span>  <br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span><span data-text=\"ὑπομονῆς\">ὑπομο<span class=\"petraelig